      "statement": "Before any commit/PR, run_deterministic_precommit runs the worktree's .zerofactory/precommit.sh (format → build → test) with CI=1 and a timeout, capturing the full stdout/stderr and skipping only when ZEROFACTORY_SKIP_PRECOMMIT is set.",
