    {
      "id": "claim_dfa80aa93d1a4b0886e05e6d11c2d1dc",
      "statement": "When an agent actor reports done the task stays running with metadata['awaiting_pr']=true and _package_and_open_pr is the single owner of the packaging phase: idempotently running precommit, commit, merge against latest main, push (with an HTTPS-to-SSH fallback when the OAuth token lacks workflow scope), opening the GitHub PR, and routing the ticket to zf-reviewer on each cycle until it succeeds; the phase has a 3-attempt failure budget (_handle_packaging_failure: increments packaging_retries, stores last_packaging_error, then parks the task in blocked with blocked_reason_type='stuck' and assignee=human), and _finalize_terminal_done only cleans up (stop stale worker, prune worktree, close the open PR when close_pr is set) and never commits, pushes, opens a PR, or routes the task back to review.",
